41:  * globals that will be reported as a unbound expression. This is expected because the evaluator will still fail
42:  * on these expressions.
43:  *
44:  * @param expression The expression to analyze, either as a string or pre-parsed expression.
45:  * @returns An array of variable names that are unbound in the expression.
